e query [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]matched.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]fuzzy_artifact_ref_completion.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-b3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-b3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Canonical fuzzy matcher in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fuzzy[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fuzzy: add the shared tier/score/runs fuzzy matcher and its ordering [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]comparator to crates/sase_core/src/editor/fuzzy.rs, with the three-pass [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]alignment that makes highlights land on the segment the user meant.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bundled document discovery depth[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docwalk[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docwalk: teach plan/read.rs to discover markdown inside bundle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]directories one level below a month shard, skipping dot-directories and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the prompts/specs trees the prompt corpus owns.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fuzzy at-reference menu and match runs on the wire[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]menu[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fuzzy[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]menu: rewire build_at_reference_menu onto the fuzzy matcher for kinds, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]payloads, and the path partial; make payload rows carry the payload as [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]their label plus title, match runs, and tier; keep empty-query order and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prefix-only Tab extension.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Zero-marshalling payload index binding[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]binding[dim] · [dim][/dim]after menu[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding: add the opaque AtReferenceInventory pyclass built once [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]off-thread, let at_reference_menu accept it instead of re-marshalling [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every payload row per keystroke, and expose the fuzzy matcher to Python.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Server-side fuzzy completion for editors[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]lsp[dim] · [dim][/dim]after menu[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lsp: return an incomplete list with filter text equal to the typed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference so clients keep server-ranked fuzzy rows, and put the matched [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runs and title into item documentation and label details.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reachable, bounded, per-kind payload catalogs[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]after docwalk, binding[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog: load document payloads per document role with per-role caps [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of one shared 500-row cap, drop the prompt corpus from the warm,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and memoize the payload index plus row metadata per project and kind so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keystrokes do no O(rows) Python work.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt-input rendering of paths and matched runs[/bol